/target
Cargo.lock.bak
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store

# ts-rs output — generated by `cargo run --bin gen-ts`. Worker CI regenerates
# this on every run and compares against the committed copy in
# `ref-files-worker/src/types/`, so committing it here would just create
# two sources of truth.
/ts-bindings/
# ts-rs default export prefix (`cargo test` writes export tests here even
# when gen-ts steers output to ./ts-bindings/ via TS_RS_EXPORT_DIR).
/bindings/
